1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Hi, I am HyuckJae Lee, also known as gsuda.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:15,000
This is gsuda-engine: a provenance-first self-evolving trading loop for Korean equities.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Claude drafts. Data validates. Risk Guardian deploys.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The project comes from 23 years operating Korean securities systems and 13 years studying Saju and Yeokhak.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:48,000
The claim is not that Saju predicts stock prices. The claim is that domain-informed categorical features can be tested empirically.

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:03,000
This command runs the full closed loop: recommendations, outcomes, failure clustering, Claude rule drafting, validation, and deployment.

7
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Stage 1 logs simulated recommendations with technical indicators, Saju pillars, original Hanja provenance, solar-term timing, and hidden-stem proxy weights.

8
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Stage 2 tags T+5 outcomes. Stage 3 clusters failures and uses Claude Agent SDK to draft candidate skill files.

9
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Stage 4 runs the validation gate. Stage 5 deploys only validated rules to Risk Guardian.

10
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Here we have one promoted rule and one quarantined rule.

11
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:28,000
This is the promoted rule. The judge-facing label is English: Metal Goat.

12
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:45,000
The compact validation key is MetalGoat. The original Hanja, 辛未, is preserved as domain provenance.

13
00:02:45,000 --> 00:03:04,000
The rule records the failed trade IDs, trigger conditions, and backtest statistics.

14
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:25,000
This rule was rejected by the validation gate. It matched enough history, but winner damage was too high.

15
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:42,000
That is the key design principle: gated self-improvement, not autonomous self-modification.

16
00:03:42,000 --> 00:04:02,000
The public demo is compact and reproducible.

17
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:25,000
The broader local research warehouse covers Korean equities from 1995 to 2026, with more than 11 million enriched rows and more than 2,700 stocks.

18
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:45,000
The demo packages the core validation loop so judges can run it without private infrastructure.

19
00:04:45,000 --> 00:05:00,000
gsuda-engine turns trading failures into validated behavioral memory. Claude drafts. Data validates. Risk Guardian deploys.
